  "original_title": "A la Medianoche Vol. 2",
  "overview": "A chilling return to the shadows, At Midnight: Volume 2 delves deeper into the haunted heart of northern Mexico. This new anthology brings to life six terrifying legends from the Comarca Lagunera—where real stories and supernatural whispers collide. Encounter vengeful spirits, cursed rituals, and nightmarish apparitions in tales such as The Boy Who Flew Over Torreón, The Witches of Mercado Juárez, Jesús Solís: The Blind Collector, The Goblin of Venustiano Carranza Forest, La Cubana, and The Tzitzimimeh. Each chapter uncovers a new layer of Mexico’s ancestral fear, resurrecting local folklore. Dare to wander the desert after dark?",
